PMBRS adopts a replaceable subsystem philosophy. Embedding models, clustering systems, feature extraction pipelines, LLM providers, evaluation methods, storage backends, visualization layers, and ingestion adapters are intentionally designed to remain modular and replaceable so long as they preserve canonical artifact contracts, temporal semantics, lineage requirements, and reproducibility guarantees.
