authoritative behavioral artifacts,
canonical temporal semantics,
lineage DAGs,
experiment history,
evaluation artifacts,
and artifact contracts/schemas,
rather than in any specific model architecture, storage engine, analytical pipeline, or interface implementation. Models, adapters, feature systems, and interpretive layers are expected to evolve and be replaceable over time while preserving the governed behavioral history and reproducible transformation structure of the system.
